lor:black\">Bootstrap iterations: 0 <u></u><u></u></span></pre>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b> </b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b> </b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Abundance estimate<u></u><u></u></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">Predicted      SE             lower          upper          ki.mainland<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">14.781568\r\n     5.0528655      7.5639660      28.886270      ki<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">1.304319\r\n      0.7477629      0.4240256      4.012135     \r\n mainland<u></u><u></u></span></p></div>"
